# LKH TSP solver scratch. fast_exploration_manager.cpp:68,817 rewrites
# single.par/.tsp with ofstream on every solve and reads single.txt back
# (:849,:852), so these are per-run output, not source. test.par/.tsp/.txt
# stay tracked, which also keeps the resource/ directory in a fresh clone.
single.par
single.tsp
single.txt

# minco_planner/config/traj.rviz — rviz rewrites its config on exit, so this
# churned ~100 lines per run. No launch file references it (the traj.rviz in
# the launch files is test_interface's, a different file).
traj.rviz
